{"ref":"BDB, צֹ֫עַר","hw":"צֹ֫עַר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צֹ֫עַר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">צ֫וֹעַר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. Zoar (</strong>understood as <em>insignificance</em>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:20\" href=\"/Genesis.19.20\">Gn 19:20</a><strong>)</strong>;—Σηγωρ, 𝔊L Σιγωρ, but <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:10\" href=\"/Genesis.13.10\">Gn 13:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.34\">Je 48:34</a> Ζογορ(α); on 𝔊 cf. furhter Lag<sup>BN 54 f.</sup>: city at SE. end of Dead Sea, <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹעַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 13:10\" href=\"/Genesis.13.10\">Gn 13:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:2\" href=\"/Genesis.14.2\">14:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 14:8\" href=\"/Genesis.14.8\">8</a> (both = <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּלַע</span>), <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 34:3\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.34.3\">Dt 34:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15:5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.34\">Je 48:34</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צוֹעַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:22\" href=\"/Genesis.19.22\">Gn 19:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:30\" href=\"/Genesis.19.30\">30</a><sup>(×2)</sup>; c. ה loc., <span dir=\"rtl\">צֹ֫עֲרָה</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:23\" href=\"/Genesis.19.23\">23</a> + <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.4\">Je 48:4</a> (for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">צעוריה</span>), 𝔊 Ζογορα, JDMich Ew Gf Gie al.—cf. Buhl<sup>Geogr. 271. 274</sup> GASm<sup>Geogr. 506 f. 678 (App.)</sup>.","next":"BDB, צָעִיר","prev":"BDB, צָעַר"}